{"id":2751,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>为落实我校新学期安全教育工作要求，筑牢校园安全防线，我院于3月5日在15305Z教室召开“守护校园安全，共筑美好青春”专题班会，本次班会由班主任刘莉莉老师主持，我院全体研究生参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUzvLiL8UZnNM7LM7V7MRnVnzWRnlloDolCaM7LPnRW7Lz90gihFp2hmCIa0MkhfoSyYoShVL7V7U4vPLRfknzMVMzUbLlMkMzUbLz9PMNQFUNLPUzNboRQFL8LDnlUJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4oRlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6385&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4A929E0ADC7100BE3E5491CB5491816F/BC1A9986/3C6ED\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 503px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gM4VL2nNM7LRQ2LMzLaMznkMm94Lz9oZn7UZnzn2nl-YLNU0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hVMky4LYhfnzCZnzGaU4NDLmCPUmM7U4f2LNWRL8LZnlMFnNW2ozv8L7rFL4Gin7LPgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDL49igtA8pUucc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6385&e=.jpg\"></p><p>刘老师围绕校园安全重点工作进行讲解。她强调，安全是学习生活的基础，必须常抓不懈，警钟长鸣。在食品安全方面，提醒同学们选择正规餐饮场所，注意饮食卫生，养成良好的生活习惯；在宿舍安全方面，强调严禁使用违规电器，离开宿舍时切断电源与关好门窗；针对当前高发的电信诈骗，刘老师结合案例提醒大家增强防范意识，做到“不轻信、不透露、不转账”，遇可疑情况及时求助。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gnNMLRo7n2LmvaMMm7PUzrkL8U4nRVofLzT2MmAkU462ozN0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhVLky4USh7n7VVLmlYUmv4Lm-PM7lZLRM7M4-sL4Q7MRQFnmfRUNlbL8WFMz-DnzNJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4oRlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6385&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DE03ADDAE252B732214E803D72736D46/F0CBE93B/526E9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 492px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUNlLYnz7aLRGbMMmlaMRGbUN7PUNro7MmA7LzVfoRLanR-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yPLSybMYybn7n2L4LYUzffozlZU478MNWVU4AkLlMVMRfFLNr7U4vDM4MFL87iL87sgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDL49igtA8pUucc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6385&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次班会切实增强了同学们的安全防范意识和自我保护能力，为新学期校园安全工作夯实了基础。未来，学院将持续聚焦学生安全需求，推动安全教育工作常态化，致力于构建全方位、长效化的校园安全屏障。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUzvLiL8UZnNM7LM7V7MRnVnzWRnlloDolCaM7LPnRW7Lz90gihFp2hmCIa0MkhfoSyYoShVL7V7U4vPLRfknzMVMzUbLlMkMzUbLz9PMNQFUNLPUzNboRQFL8LDnlUJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C4oRlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6385&e=.jpg"}